# Obsidian-first (mandatory)

**All project rules and docs live in Obsidian — not in this repo.**

Before coding, designing, or operating on DataSync:

1. Open **`/home/iks/Documents/Obsidian Vault/DataSync/Cursor Rules Hub.md`** — workflow, indexes (mini-RAG), rules
2. Read **`/home/iks/Documents/Obsidian Vault/DataSync/DataSync.md`** and the relevant index pages (deploy notes, C++ hubs) for your task
3. Apply the rules that match your task (observability, pipeline knobs, documentation, etc.)

After **every meaningful change**, update Obsidian per **`DataSync/Rules/Obsidian Project Docs.md`** — link new topics from `DataSync/DataSync.md`.

Do **not** recreate `.cursor/rules/` (except this file) or `docs/` in the repo. The vault is the single source of truth.
